  m_Name: Ia
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::SuspectData
  FirstName: Ia
  LastName: Lomidze
  Nickname: The Witch
  Occupation: Librarian
  CharacterDescription: Speaks in riddles, avoids direct answers, unsettling calm.
    Almost like she knows what's going to happen, and knows your fate, which is ultimately
    a dark one.
  CharacterArc: Droopy, heavy-lidded eyes and a piercing gaze. She is unsettlingly
    calm, speaking in vague riddles and metaphors. Her arc isn't one of fear, but
    of predestination. She views the apocalypse as a book finally reaching its last
    chapter, and she treats the player like a character whose ending she has already
    read.
  DateOfBirth: 30/08/1958
  Sex: Female
  EntryPermitExpiryDate: 05 DEC
  IsResident: 1
  GivesPaperwork: 1
  handwritingFont: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f8e89ead54f8523428cc2e34f005bb5e, type: 2}
